      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have seen this bug as well, although I think your fps drop is not directly tied to the bug itself but just a symptom of the particle system being spammed, as I've never observed fps drops. \nFrom what I can tell it spams the last transition that fired off in your FX animator. It seems to fire the last FX state change when any OTHER state change in the FX animator fires, and because of this I believe it is a symptom of the same issue that causes the problem I detailed here: https://vrchat.canny.io/avatar-30/p/1078-bug-removing-additive-layer-has-a-random-chance-of-breaking-gesture-based-s",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
