      "value": "@{5baf2b2de038c00e28fd16b5|full_name}: You are right. This type of last transition spams become more apparent when on station. It sucks because I've never had this issue before when I was shooting particles or doing animation while sitting. I only knew about when people telling me that I was causing performance issues only when I was seated. I hope this get fixed soon.",
