  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I recently noticed this bug when a couple of users with av3 are having animation bug when sitting on stations. And not only that, it causes our frames to drop when looking at that affected avatar. When I tried testing it for myself, not only the animation is bugged but also particles that are under constraints are affected as well and began behaving violently. I'm not sure if other components are also affected by this. I think that this violent behaviour that occurs when on station is causing the frames to drop.\nTo recreate this bug, I guess you use an avatar 3.0 with animations, world particles, constraints, etc. Find a station/chair and compare your fps when you are in and out of the station.\n\nEdit:\n\nVideo: https://youtu.be/OZWAqQrKzYg",
